OK, my bad (as I mentioned before, I don't have OSX here, otherwise I'd 
have tried my advice before I gave it to you). Aparantly you have to be 
in the root of the .app and not in the dir with the binary when you run 
it. So you have to do it like this:

su - wizard
PASSWORD
cd /bla/nethack.app
Contents/MacOS/nethack -u wizard -D

